  "result": "Done! Added `addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })` and `removeLine(invoice, sku)` to src/invoices.js:\n\n**New functions:**\n- `addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })` \u2014 adds a new line or increments qty if SKU already exists; validates qty and SKU; requires draft status\n- `removeLine(invoice, sku)` \u2014 removes a line by SKU; prevents removal of last line; requires draft status\n\n**Error handling:**\n- Both functions return NOT_DRAFT if invoice status isn't 'draft'\n- addLine validates like createInvoice: QTY_INVALID, UNKNOWN_SKU\n- removeLine returns LINE_NOT_FOUND (SKU not found) or NO_LINES (would remove last line)\n\n**Tests added:** 15 new tests covering adding new lines, incrementing existing lines, validation, status checks, edge cases, and immutability\n\n**Test results:** \u2705 All 46 tests pass (31 existing + 15 new)",
